sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend
    participant G as Groq AI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>F: Type natural language question
    F->>B: POST /api/ai/query { question }
    B->>B: Get available table schemas
    B->>G: Send prompt + schema context
    G-->>B: Generated SQL query
    B->>DB: Execute generated SQL
    DB-->>B: Query results
    B->>B: Generate insights from data
    B-->>F: { sql, data, insights }
    F-->>U: Display results & chart
    U->>F: Click "Save as Chart"
    F->>B: POST /api/charts { config }
    B-->>F: Chart created
